description	"Kaevee

A fallen Jedi Padawan who survived the bombing of the enclave, uses controlled beasts to her advantage.

^2Weaponry: 
- Melee
- Lightsaber
-- Yellow Style
-- Blaster Defense/Deflect (2)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- BP Free Jumps

^8Attributes:
- Force Focus (2)
- Saber/Blaster Defense (1)
- Force Block (1)
- Lights Beacon
- Deflect (1)
- Blast Armor
- Environmental Protection (1)
- Dexterity (1) (Dex Roll) ^3[CS4 Weapon Out]
- Aerial Force Regen
- Knockdown Roll 
- Stamina (3) ^3[CS1]
- Force Control (Pet Control) ^3[CS2]
--^1 Disclaimer - Cant Attack, Use For Repositioning
- Sense Immunity
- Tamed Jagrek Warrior (Round Spawn Giant Insect)
- Summon Jabrek Drone (Support Beacon Insect Scout) ^3[CS3]

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (2)
- Speed (1) ^3[CS3]
- Repulse ^3[CS4 Melee]
- Grip (2)
- Protect (3)
- Jolt (Lightning) (1)
-- Causes Slippery"

